
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-xdvi 1.2 --- status: recommended

These are the binaries for xdvi, a program to display dvi files under X. It
can also display epsf files which are included in dvi files. Therefore you
need ghostscript (gs). The current version of xdvik is 18b using the kpathsea
library 2.1. 

